WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Kneel with knees together, tops of the feet flat on the mat, big toes close.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Sit the hips back onto the heels — or onto a block between the heels.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Lengthen the spine tall, crown reaching up, shoulders soft.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Rest the palms on the thighs, facing up or down.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Stay for quiet breaths; shift to one side to exit and stretch the legs.
